    <sys:String x:Key="Fn_Trim">Trim Clip</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Fn_Gif">GIF Export</sys:String>

    <sys:String x:Key="Param_Scale">Upscale</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Param_Denoise">Denoise</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Param_Sharpen">Sharpen</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Param_Temporal">Temporal blend frames</sys:String>

    <sys:String x:Key="Hint_Enhance">Filter-only pipeline: Lanczos upscale + HQDN3D denoise + Unsharp. No super-resolution model, so added detail is interpolation and quality is bounded by the source.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Hint_Mosaic">Denoise + sharpen + temporal blend reduce the blocky look. This is an approximation, not real reconstruction; removed detail cannot be recovered.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Hint_Watermark">Drag on the preview to select regions (multiple allowed). delogo interpolates over them; hidden content is not reconstructed.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Hint_Compose">The first video defines output size, frame rate and pixel format. Side-by-side or picture-in-picture; audio follows the first video.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Hint_Concat">Clips are joined in list order with normalized resolution/frame rate/pixel format. Output is silent.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Hint_M3u8">Pick a local m3u8 playlist (relative ts segments supported). Stream copy is tried first, then re-encode. Segments encrypted with a remote key cannot be decrypted offline.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Hint_Audio">Audio-only export; video is not re-encoded. Format and bitrate are selectable.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Hint_Trim">Fast mode copies the stream and snaps the start to a keyframe. Precise mode re-encodes with an exact start time.</sys:String>

    <sys:String x:Key="Roi_Tip">Drag here to select a watermark region</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Roi_Clear">Clear regions</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Roi_Empty">No region selected; the bottom-right 30% area is used by default</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Roi_Count">{0} region(s) selected</sys:String>

